<title>USA: Adaptive Solutions names Meub as CEO.</title>
<headline>Adaptive Solutions names Meub as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adaptive Solutions Inc said its board of directors named Daniel Meub as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He was also named a director.</p>
<p>Meub replaces Dan Hammerstrom, the company founder who has been interim chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Meub was most recently executive vice president of marketing and product development at Now Software Inc of Portland, Ore.</p>
<p>Adaptive Solutions makes data parallel computing processes for advanced pattern recognition, image processing and ICR applications.</p>
